# Cerebral Download: "Surveil X, where X is the number of artifacts you control. Then draw three cards." With Dimir
# Spybug: "Whenever you surveil, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature." Bot1 casts the Spybug on turn 1 (Island and Mox
# Jet), with Mox Sapphire and Sol Ring also out. On turn 3 Bot1 casts Cerebral Download with all three artifacts still
# on the battlefield: X is 3, so Bot1 looks at Counterspell, Lightning Bolt and Ponder, puts all three into the graveyard,
# and draws the three Islands beneath. The Spybug gets one counter for the one surveil, however many cards were looked
# at (the ruling), and the trigger comes after the whole spell has resolved.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Sol Ring
Mox Jet
Dimir Spybug
Cerebral Download
Swamp
Island
Counterspell
Lightning Bolt
Ponder
Island
Island
Island
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

